    "When do two prefix sums differ by a multiple of k?",
    "When they have the same remainder mod k. Remember the first index where each remainder appeared.",
    "first = {0: -1}\ntotal = 0\nfor i, x in enumerate(nums):\n    total = (total + x) % k\n    if total in first:\n        if i - first[total] >= 2: return true\n    else: first[total] = i\nreturn false",
